    "body": "Is it better to have this at the end of the `let env_name =` line?\r\n\r\ni.e.,\r\n`let env_name = module.config_value_str(\"variable\")?;`\r\n\r\nThat way, `env_name` will be an `&str` rather than `Option<&str>`, and you can drop the `unwrap` from line 25.\r\n",
